 "design": "Per model one new cell: the SAME AArch64 vmfb and contract, the SAME fixture as an archived map-arm cFS run, UNCONDITIONAL admission at M = B_u, and exactly one changed SETTING -- AI_LEARNER_BLOB_ALIGN_OFFSET moves the module image off the 64-byte class so try_map's import is refused and the copy arm runs. No recompilation (0 iree-compile calls); the app knob is fail-closed and refuses outright when the conditional tier is enabled (plan SS2.1). The app BINARY is not held fixed against the archived baselines -- see changed_variable_scope.",
